{"3850970": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mystery Egg Shop Simulator", "steam_appid": 3850970, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Egg Shop Simulator</strong> is a simulation game where you manage every aspect of a shop that sells collectible mystery eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Manage Your Shop</strong></u><br>You are in full control. Start with an empty space and build it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/198a84ecfc561ede4cbbc1f804c71d53.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/198a84ecfc561ede4cbbc1f804c71d53.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/198a84ecfc561ede4cbbc1f804c71d53.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Stocking:</strong> Order inventory using your in-store computer and physically place the eggs on your shelves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/30788676caef6536ac5ff41b13015e25.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/30788676caef6536ac5ff41b13015e25.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/30788676caef6536ac5ff41b13015e25.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Price Control:</strong> Set the price for each type of egg and adjust based on supply and demand.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Checkout &amp; Operations:</strong> Scan items, take cash and card payments, and keep your store clean to attract more customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expansion:</strong> Use your profits to expand your store's physical space, buy more shelving, and upgrade your point-of-sale system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/ba620dbce0de4f9e3e4a1c3217f93ee0.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/ba620dbce0de4f9e3e4a1c3217f93ee0.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/ba620dbce0de4f9e3e4a1c3217f93ee0.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/b1a2680a89e09fbbd46b6b8a16fea3b8.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/b1a2680a89e09fbbd46b6b8a16fea3b8.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/b1a2680a89e09fbbd46b6b8a16fea3b8.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Open Eggs, Find Figures</strong></u><br>The core of your business offers a strategic choice:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell Sealed:</strong> Sell mystery eggs directly to customers for a consistent, reliable income.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Open for Profit:</strong> Open the eggs yourself. Inside are collectible action figures with different rarities (Common, Uncommon, Rare, Legendary). A rare figure is worth far more than the sealed egg.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Craft and Sell Dioramas</strong></u><br>Don't just sell loose figures. Maximize their value with the crafting system.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Themed Sets:</strong> Collect figures that belong to the same theme, like &quot;Space,&quot; &quot;Fantasy,&quot; or &quot;Dinosaurs.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Dioramas:</strong> Place a complete set of themed figures onto the corresponding diorama base.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sell for High Value:</strong> A finished diorama is a premium product that sells for a significantly higher price than the sum of its parts. This is the key to making big money.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Grow Your Business</strong></u><br>Start small and build your way up. Reinvest your earnings to unlock new series of mystery eggs, each with it’s own unique set of figures and dioramas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>First-Person Shop Management:</strong> Physically run your store, from stocking shelves to operating the cash register.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory and Price Management:</strong> Order stock via a computer and set your own prices for all products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbox and Collect:</strong> Open mystery eggs to find hundreds of different action figures across multiple themed sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figure Rarity System:</strong> Figures range from common to legendary, directly impacting their value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diorama Crafting System:</strong> Combine figures of the same theme on a diorama base to create high-value collector's items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Expansion and Upgrades:</strong> Grow your store's physical size, improve your equipment, and customize its appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Marketplace:</strong> Real Player to Player online marketplace, where you can sell your rare findings to other players or buy the items you need to complete your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Order System:</strong> Besides in-store customers, you can receive  in-game online orders, which you can fulfill for extra cash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle &amp; Customer AI:</strong> Manage your shop during open hours and prepare for the next day after closing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> </u></strong><br> <br> <br> <br> </p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mystery Egg Shop Simulator</strong> is a simulation game where you manage every aspect of a shop that sells collectible mystery eggs.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/2380d544e0e4262723ae9737d1529112.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>Manage Your Shop</strong></u><br>You are in full control. Start with an empty space and build it out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/198a84ecfc561ede4cbbc1f804c71d53.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/198a84ecfc561ede4cbbc1f804c71d53.webm?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/198a84ecfc561ede4cbbc1f804c71d53.mp4?t=1787344808\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physical Stocking:</strong> Order inventory using your in-store computer and physically place the eggs on your shelves.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3850970/extras/30788676caef6536ac5ff41b13015e25.poster.avif?t=1787344808\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\