ally run your store, from stocking shelves to operating the cash register.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inventory and Price Management:</strong> Order stock via a computer and set your own prices for all products.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unbox and Collect:</strong> Open mystery eggs to find hundreds of different action figures across multiple themed sets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Figure Rarity System:</strong> Figures range from common to legendary, directly impacting their value.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diorama Crafting System:</strong> Combine figures of the same theme on a diorama base to create high-value collector's items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Store Expansion and Upgrades:</strong> Grow your store's physical size, improve your equipment, and customize its appearance.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Marketplace:</strong> Real Player to Player online marketplace, where you can sell your rare findings to other players or buy the items you need to complete your collection</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online Order System:</strong> Besides in-store customers, you can receive  in-game online orders, which you can fulfill for extra cash</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day/Night Cycle &amp; Customer AI:</strong> Manage your shop during open hours and prepare for the next day after closing.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><u> </u></strong><br> <br> <br> <br> </p>", "short_description": "Run your very own mystery egg shop! Stock shelves, manage customers, and grow your business. Every egg hides a surprise, you can sell them sealed, or open them to discover what’s inside? Unbox action figures, trade collectibles, and build themed dioramas to increase their value.", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Turkish, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil,